      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Create 3 different recipes.\n\nUse the following user preferences:\n\nCooking time: {{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.preferences[0].cookingTime.join(\", \") }}\nCuisine: {{$('Webhook').item.json.body.preferences[0].cuisine[0]}}\nDiet: {{$('Webhook').item.json.body.preferences[0].diet[0]}}\nPersons: {{$('Webhook').item.json.body.preferences[0].persons}}\n\nUse these ingredients EXACTLY as \"myIngredients\".\nKeep the quantity and unit exactly as provided:\n\n{{$('Webhook').item.json.body.ingredients\n  .map(i => `${i.amount} ${i.selectedUnit} ${i.ingredient}`)\n  .join(\"\\n\")}}\n\nReturn ONLY a valid JSON object with exactly one top-level key: \"recipes\".\n\nThe output must be:\n{\n  \"recipes\": [ ... exactly 3 recipe objects ... ]\n}\n\nInside \"recipes\", return exactly 3 recipe objects.\n\nEach recipe object must contain ONLY these keys:\ntitle, nutritionalInformations, myIngredients, extraIngredients, steps, cookingtime, cuisine, diet, persons, likes, id\n\nRules:\n\n- nutritionalInformations must be exactly 4 strings in this order:\n  1) \"Energy: <number> kcal\"\n  2) \"Protein: <number> g\"\n  3) \"Fat: <number> g\"\n  4) \"Carbs: <number> g\"\n\n- myIngredients:\n  MUST be an array of strings.\n  Each string MUST contain quantity + unit + ingredient name.\n  Example: \"200 g potatoes\", \"1 tbsp olive oil\".\n  Use the provided webhook ingredients as the base and do not remove them.\n\n- extraIngredients:\n  MUST be an array of 0 to 3 strings.\n  Each string MUST contain quantity + unit + ingredient name.\n  Example: \"1 tbsp oil\", \"200 ml broth\".\n\n- steps: array of 1 to 5 short cooking instructions.\n\n- cookingtime: string like \"20mins\".\n\n- cuisine must be exactly:\n  \"{{$('Webhook').item.json.body.preferences[0].cuisine[0]}}\"\n\n- diet must be exactly:\n  \"{{$('Webhook').item.json.body.preferences[0].diet[0]}}\"\n\n- persons must be the number:\n  {{$('Webhook').item.json.body.preferences[0].persons}}\n\n- likes must always be 0.\n\n- id must be a 6-digit number (100000-999999).",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {}
